message: "If you use VecForge in your work, please cite the paper below."
title: "VecForge"
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-17
license-url: "https://github.com/bosekarmegam/vecforge/blob/main/LICENSE"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bosekarmegam/vecforge"
url: "https://bosekarmegam.github.io/vecforge/"
abstract: >-
  VecForge is a local-first Python vector database with hybrid dense and BM25
  retrieval, AES-256 encrypted storage, persistent memory for AI agents over
  the Model Context Protocol, and a closed-form Grover-inspired reranker.
keywords:
  - vector database
  - hybrid retrieval
  - BM25
  - FAISS
  - agent memory
  - Model Context Protocol
  - amplitude amplification
